{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "brewops-api-collection",
    "name": "BrewOps API",
    "description": "Full BrewOps backend API collection.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import `BrewOps-Local.postman_environment.json` and select **BrewOps Local**.\n2. Start Postgres (Docker) and run the app with profile `dev` (`spring.profiles.active=dev`) so payment complete/fail endpoints are available.\n3. Run **Flows → Happy Path (Guest Checkout)** in order, or use individual folders.\n\n**Auth**\n- Guest cart/order/payment: no token.\n- Kitchen: JWT with `STAFF` or `ADMIN` role.\n- Admin inventory & refund: JWT with `ADMIN` role.\n- After login, `token` is saved automatically.\n\n**Stripe**\n- Set env `STRIPE_ENABLED=true` on the server and use real PaymentIntent flow; webhook via Stripe CLI to `POST /api/v1/webhooks/stripe`.\n- For local MVP without Stripe, use **Payments → Complete Payment (dev)**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Flows",
      "description": "Run these requests top-to-bottom for an end-to-end guest checkout and kitchen flow.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 - Get Menu",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/menu"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('sessionId', pm.environment.get('sessionId') || ('guest-' + Date.now()));",
                  "pm.environment.set('idempotencyKey', 'pay-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const menu = pm.response.json();",
                  "let variantId = null;",
                  "for (const cat of menu) {",
                  "  for (const p of cat.products || []) {",
                  "    for (const v of p.variants || []) {",
                  "      if (v.availableQuantity > 0) { variantId = v.variantId; break; }",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (variantId) break;",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (variantId) break;",
                  "}",
                  "if (variantId) pm.environment.set('variantId', variantId);",
                  "else console.warn('No variant with stock found in menu');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "02 - Add to Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\",\n  \"variantId\": \"{{variantId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "03 - Create Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('orderId', body.orderId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "04 - Create Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{idempotencyKey}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('paymentId', body.paymentId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "05 - Complete Payment (dev)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/complete"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Payment SUCCESS', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('SUCCESS'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "06 - Get Order Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Order PAID', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('PAID'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "07 - Kitchen Start PREPARING",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"PREPARING\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "08 - Kitchen Mark READY",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"READY\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "09 - Kitchen Mark COMPLETED",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"COMPLETED\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
